ZLSplitter for WebCLAP (ports/zl-splitter), all under ZL_WEBCLAP:

- PluginProcessor.cpp: ZL_WEBCLAP_HEADLESS builds the processor without its editor (module.wasm)
- controller.hpp: ZLWebclapAccess (ports/zl-splitter/zl_splitter_access.h) as a friend, for the analyzer switch
  that crosses over as a frame
- curve_panel.cpp: no threads, so the analyzer worker loop runs one pass per repaint (paintOverChildren) on the
  editor's thread instead of waiting for notify()
- compact_combobox.cpp: the kit's JUCE has no popup item tooltips (ZL's JUCE fork adds them)

